    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A never-before-seen horror game is the only evidence found at a crime scene. As a retired game designer hired to investigate the case, you find a hidden mode that pulls you into a spiraling descent into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you unearth more enigmatic games, you\u2019ll breach the boundaries of their worlds, unraveling horrifying truths that transcend fiction\u2014and even reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394500/extras/ee687eb19122cfdb58d54b0c10473616.avif?t=1736794772\" data-has-big width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mind Bending Horror Narrative</strong>: Experience an intricate story that twists and turns through layers of fear, mystery, and unsettling truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely Original Gameplay: </strong>Innovative mechanics and meticulously crafted design deliver disturbing, unforgettable moments that linger well beyond your last save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Immersive Universe: </strong>A story-rich world and meaningful gameplay that act as a whole, full of surprises, secrets and terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obsessively Meticulous Art Direction: </strong>Striking visuals that bring a believable universe to life to the last pixel, filled with rich character and hauntingly immersive areas that crawl under your skin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-layered puzzles: </strong>Solve original puzzles that unfold across multiple layers and are seamlessly integrated into the narrative world\u2014no fillers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394500/extras/279966025e37426d44ce511da1f4f693.avif?t=1736794772\" data-has-big width=800 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playmestudio is an independent studio which focuses on completely original, carefully crafted gaming experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re pretty serious about games; we aim for the heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Simulation is under active development. Published by Blumhouse Games.</p>",
